      "transformation": "Cursor-specific transcript paths, cloud-agent assumptions, implicit subagent parsing, and prose-only resume notes were replaced by workspace-scoped trails, an off-worktree structured checkpoint with exact Git anchors, stale-state refusal, inherited-versus-redone accounting, and fresh authorization for every mutation or publication. Pause and pickup remain separate explicit workflows so unattended continuation cannot be misread as a request to stop."
